WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:08.508
Okay, then.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:14.180
You can still continue,
even if I use this, right?

00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:18.601
That idiot is doing it again
in spite of me!

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.770
Here it comes!

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:26.901
KURE FAMILY'S SECRET TECHNIQUE: REMOVAL

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:30.905
Who cares?

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:35.076
Whoever you are, I'll just kill you!

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.538
Ohma's eyes...

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.833
He looks quite similar to the Kure's!

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:46.087
You've quit being human, right?

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:48.548
But you're still not at my level.

00:00:48.965 --> 00:00:50.550
Just shut up and die!

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:58.975
Ohma's gotten stronger.

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:03.855
But if you continue fighting
in that way, your body will...

